"approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-170.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-170[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Tribe clan summaries and durable clan records[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Selecting an agent tribe panel shows the summary of every clan in [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the tribe through a fast, fold-aware CLAN SUMMARIES section with a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]useful one-line-per-clan default. A clan's summary and chosen tribe[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]are recorded durably per clan generation, so they survive member [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]kills, dismissals, relaunches, and full reloads, and they seed the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]defaults when a clan with the same name is created again.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]tribe_clan_summaries_and_clan_records.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]CLAN SUMMARIES section in the tribe metadata panel[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]tribe_clan_summaries[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tribe_clan_summaries: add a fold-aware CLAN SUMMARIES section after [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]TRIBE MEMBERS, backed by worker-side cached summary digests (kicker, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]headline, lede, styled body lines), with a Glance index, Triage ledes, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Inspect previews, Forensics full bodies, per-entry za/zA folds, docs, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unit tests, and PNG goldens.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Durable clan record store in sase-core[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]clan_record_core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]clan_record_core: in the linked sase-core repo, add the per-clan JSON [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record store (schema, merge rules, bounded locks, atomic writes, mtime [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cache), apply records over clan context in all three scan/index paths [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]through a new clan_records_dir scan option, add capture-from-artifacts [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and launch-default resolution, and expose four Python bindings with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Record, capture, and read clan attributes from sase[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]clan_record_wiring[dim] · [dim][/dim]after clan_record_core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]clan_record_wiring: bump the sase-core pin, add the Python facade, pass [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the records dir through every scan, record summaries and tribes at [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]launch and on summary refresh, capture records before any artifact [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]deletion, make the wait index honor recorded tribes, update docs, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add regression tests for the lost summary scenarios.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Clan-level tribe edits from the Agents tab[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]clan_tribe_edits[dim] · [dim][/dim]after clan_record_wiring[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]clan_tribe_edits: make the tribe modal on a clan member or the synthetic[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]clan row write an Edited clan record (including sticky unsets) through [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the durable directive path, with optimistic display, modal copy, docs, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Inherit remembered tribe and summary for new clan generations[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]clan_launch_defaults[dim] · [dim][/dim]after clan_record_wiring[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]clan_launch_defaults: when a launch creates a new generation of a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]previously recorded clan without explicit tribe or summary, inherit the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]remembered tribe, re-run the remembered summary script (falling back to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the remembered text), record them as Inherited, log it, document it, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]test it.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-170","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-170.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-c3281e35fcf25a87bdb89ff75d9754eb","started_at":"2026-09-23T15:59:06.181704+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"b0fb22f93b3de549a3115116d2d4856970992a57ff50973e95efcfe2add52764","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-170.2/chat.md","size_bytes":2646},"commits":{"digest":"449f84331ba971f0db930eb1cb41bd2d3b980de6f81a4dabb9b1bd3ad77c33fa","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-170.2/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-170.2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"e93adfb7b1a09f19674370fa4c828ebad10ca59c07fbdc82e18ce285c1635f3c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-170.2/meta.json","size_bytes":657},"prompt":{"digest":"c677f3a54786c28b38a4097f891297970ac6b4bba63d11897b295de25a95da5a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-170.2/prompt.md","size_bytes":11